---
// src/pages/terms.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — VerseSEO"
  description="VerseSEO Terms of Service. Read the terms governing your use of VerseSEO's SEO analysis, AI visibility, and content tools."
  canonical="https://verseseo.com/terms"
>
  <Navbar />

  <main class="flex-1">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-20">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mb-10">Last updated: August 26, 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-slate prose-sm max-w-none space-y-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>By accessing or using VerseSEO ("the Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these Terms, you may not use the Service.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">2. Description of Service</h2>
          <p>VerseSEO provides software tools for SEO analysis, AI answer-engine visibility analysis, content and research tools, and related functionality. The Service may include website crawling, search-opportunity discovery, Reddit opportunity monitoring, AI visibility scoring, and content generation features.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">All results, recommendations, scores, and outputs provided by VerseSEO are informational in nature. No particular SEO ranking, search traffic, AI visibility, business outcome, or performance improvement is guaranteed. You are responsible for evaluating and acting on any outputs at your own discretion.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">3. User Accounts</h2>
          <p>To use certain features, you must create an account. You are responsible for providing accurate and complete account information and for maintaining the confidentiality of your credentials. You must not share your account credentials with others or allow unauthorized access to your account.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">You are responsible for all activity that occurs under your account. If you suspect unauthorized access, you must notify VerseSEO immediately at <a href="mailto:support@verseseo.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">support@verseseo.com</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">4. Acceptable Use</h2>
          <p>You agree not to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Use the Service for any unlawful purpose or in violation of any applicable law or regulation.</li>
            <li>Attempt to disrupt, attack, overwhelm, or interfere with the Service, its infrastructure, or its availability.</li>
            <li>Reverse engineer, decompile, or attempt to extract the source code of the Service.</li>
            <li>Bypass or attempt to bypass usage limits, rate limits, authentication mechanisms, or other access controls.</li>
            <li>Abuse, scrape, or make automated requests to the Service beyond the functionality explicitly provided by VerseSEO.</li>
            <li>Resell, sublicense, or redistribute the Service or its outputs without written permission.</li>
            <li>Use the Service to harm, harass, or infringe on the rights of others.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">5. User Content</h2>
          <p>You retain ownership of any content, data, URLs, or information you submit to VerseSEO ("User Content"). By submitting User Content, you grant VerseSEO a limited, non-exclusive license to process, store, and analyze that content solely for the purpose of providing the Service to you.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">VerseSEO will not use your User Content for purposes unrelated to providing the Service without your separate consent.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">6. Plans, Subscriptions, and Payments</h2>
          <p>VerseSEO offers free and paid subscription plans. The features, limitations, and pricing for each plan are described on the <a href="#pricing" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">pricing page</a> and at checkout.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Paid subscriptions are billed in advance on a recurring monthly basis at the price presented at checkout. By selecting a paid plan, you authorize VerseSEO to charge your payment method at the start of each billing period.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Payment processing is handled by our third-party payment provider. VerseSEO does not store full payment card details on its servers. Your payment information is subject to the payment provider's own terms and privacy policy.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">You may cancel your subscription at any time through your account settings. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period. Refunds, where applicable, are handled according to the refund terms presented at the time of purchase.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">All fees are exclusive of applicable taxes, which you may be required to pay depending on your jurisdiction.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">7. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>The Service, including its software, design, branding, logos, and documentation, is owned by VerseSEO or its licensors and is protected by applicable intellectual-property laws. These Terms do not grant you any rights to use VerseSEO's trademarks, logos, or brand elements without prior written consent.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">You retain all rights to your User Content and submitted data.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">8. Third-Party Services</h2>
          <p>VerseSEO relies on third-party infrastructure and service providers to deliver the Service. These may include cloud-hosting providers, payment processors, email delivery services, AI and language-model providers, search and data providers, and analytics tools.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">VerseSEO is not responsible for the availability, accuracy, or practices of third-party services. Your use of such services may be subject to their respective terms.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">9. Availability and Disclaimers</h2>
          <p>The Service is provided on an "as available" and "as is" basis. VerseSEO does not guarantee uninterrupted, error-free, or secure operation of the Service.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">SEO analysis, AI visibility results, content recommendations, and other outputs are generated algorithmically and may contain inaccuracies. No guarantee is made regarding the accuracy, completeness, timeliness, or reliability of any output. You should independently verify any information before relying on it.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">Use of the Service is at your sole risk. To the fullest extent permitted by law, VerseSEO disclaims all warranties, express or implied, including implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">10. Account Suspension and Termination</h2>
          <p>VerseSEO may suspend or terminate your access to the Service at any time, with or without notice, if it reasonably believes you have violated these Terms, engaged in abuse, fraud, or unlawful activity, or engaged in conduct that may expose VerseSEO to liability.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">You may stop using the Service at any time. Deleting your account may result in the removal of your data in accordance with our data-retention practices.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">11. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, VerseSEO, its officers, directors, employees, and affiliates shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of revenue, profit, data, or business opportunity, arising out of or related to your use of the Service, even if advised of the possibility of such damages.</p>
          <p class="mt-3">VerseSEO's total aggregate liability for any claims arising out of or related to these Terms or the Service shall not exceed the amount you paid to VerseSEO during the twelve (12) months immediately preceding the event giving rise to the claim.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">12. Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p>VerseSEO may update these Terms from time to time. When changes are made, the "Last updated" date at the top of this page will be revised. Material changes may be communicated through the Service or by email. Continued use of the Service after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-3">13. Contact</h2>
          <p>If you have questions about these Terms, please contact us at <a href="mailto:support@verseseo.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">support@verseseo.com</a>.</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
